# DamInspect Mobile Application Project

## Project Overview
DamInspect is an iOS and Android compatible mobile application for field staff and engineers to inspect dams, levees, aqueducts, canals, and other water infrastructure. The app supports standardized inspections (daily visual inspection, FERC Part 12D, USACE Periodic Inspection Program [ER 1110-2-100], DSOD inspection, post-earthquake inspection, post-flood inspection) and custom organization-specific inspections.

## Current Development Phase - V1.0.3
Phase 7: Testing and Quality Assurance - SYSTEMATIC DEBUGGING: Implementing hard-coded test marker and comprehensive lifecycle logging to identify why markers appear then disappear.

